Version 4
SHEET 1 2600 1500
TEXT 80 40 Left 2 ;PECORA-CARROLL SYNCHRONIZED SECURE CHAOTIC COMMUNICATIONS

* DC SUPPLIES
TEXT 80 120 Left 2 ;[DC POWER RAILS]
SYMBOL voltage 100 180 R0
