SYMATTR Value 9
WIRE 100 196 100 160
FLAG 100 160 Vpos
WIRE 100 276 100 310
FLAG 100 310 0

SYMBOL voltage 100 360 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vneg_src
SYMATTR Value 9
WIRE 100 376 100 340
FLAG 100 340 0
WIRE 100 456 100 490
FLAG 100 490 Vneg

* Secret Information Source
TEXT 80 540 Left 2 ;[SECRET MESSAGE GENERATOR]
SYMBOL voltage 100 600 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vmsg
SYMATTR Value SINE(0 0.05 1k)
WIRE 100 616 100 580
FLAG 100 580 msg
WIRE 100 696 100 730
FLAG 100 730 0

TEXT 360 80 Left 2 ;[TRANSMITTER: MASTER CHUA CHAOTIC GENERATOR]

* --- System tx ---
