SYMATTR Value V=V(Vc1_tx)+V(msg)
WIRE 2050 196 2050 150
FLAG 2050 150 S_chan
WIRE 2050 276 2050 310
FLAG 2050 310 0

TEXT 360 560 Left 2 ;[RECEIVER: SLAVE SYNCHRONIZED CHUA SUB-CIRCUIT]
